# Undead Starter (1-13): Deathknell, Brill and every loop of Tirisfal Glades (the Agamand Mills,
# the Rot Hide gnolls and the murloc coast, the Scarlet camps, Venomweb Vale and the Balnir farm,
# Gunther's island, the Agamand Family Crypt, Bandarion Keep and the Shadowvale crypt), three visits
# to Undercity, and a zeppelin trip to Orgrimmar for its errands, for an Undead duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/undead_starter_1_13.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops and the
# places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite) and the project's notes
# (notes/tirisfal-glades.toml), checked against outof.games (Tirisfal Glades, area 85; Undercity;
# Orgrimmar); Zygor's route as a check (there is no RestedXP route below level 21). Wowhead not
# consulted: the research is partial.
# The quest list is section 1 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md, plus the warriors' Agamand
# Heirlooms (1821) and Heirloom Weapon (1822), the follow-ups of Speak with Coleman (1820): no guide
# had them, and their weapon racks stand in the Agamand Family Crypt this guide clears anyway.
# Class quests: Seeking Refuge (99144) is for paladins only in the project's data (an override),
#   though outof.games shows no class: the builder keeps it for paladins, and the tip says it may not
#   be offered (not yet checked in game).
# Profession quests: Camping 101: Herbalism, Mining and Skinning show only to those with the
#   profession (`skill`); Cooking is for everyone.
# Left out: A Lesson in Divinity 94435-94441 (paladins, after 94434): no guide had them, and they
#   send a paladin from Undercity to Bandarion Keep, to Venomweb Vale and back again; Investigate
#   the Scourge of the Undercity (9265, a world event); The Power to Destroy... (5725, Ragefire
#   Chasm drops).
# The auction house: only Coarse Thread (a trade vendor's item, bought in Brill) and Linen Cloth
#   (paladins' A Lesson in Divinity: it drops from every humanoid on the way) come up: no AH stop.
#
# Starts at Undertaker Mordo, outside the crypt of Deathknell, where new Undead characters wake.
# Ends at the zeppelin tower outside Undercity, in Tirisfal Glades, off the zeppelin back from
#   Orgrimmar, where Silverpine Forest (13-15) starts.
# Flight paths learned: Undercity (Michael Garrett, which Undead may already know) and Orgrimmar
#   (Doras), which The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21) flies to.
# Left to Silverpine Forest (13-15): nothing. It takes Delivery to Silverpine Forest (445) in Brill
#   and The Deathstalkers (1886) itself; this guide stops at Mennet Carkad (1885) for rogues.
#
# The route: Deathknell (1-6); the road east to Brill, with Gordo's weeds; Brill's first loop
# (east to the Undercity road, then west to the pumpkins and the Scarlet Warriors) and the
# hearthstone back; the north (the Rot Hide gnolls, Maggot Eye, the murloc coast and the Agamand
# Mills); Undercity, then the Scarlet camp south of the road; Venomweb Vale's first part (the Cult of
# the Damned, the Bleeding Horrors, the Balnir farm) from Deathguard Linnea's camp; the east (Gunther's
# books, Riptear, the Vicious Night Web Spiders, Captain Vachon); Undercity again; Gunther's island,
# Captain Melrache's tower and the Agamand Family Crypt; Bandarion Keep and the Shadowvale crypt in
# the far west; the hearthstone to Brill, Undercity a last time, and the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and
# back.

guide Undead Starter (1-13)
races 5
levels 1 13
next Silverpine Forest (13-15)

